# Design references and session notes. Neither is servable, and Vercel uploads
# the WORKING DIRECTORY rather than the commit — so an untracked mockup and its
# photographs would ship to production without ever being committed. That is
# why the 3 Sep deploy had to move `mockups/home-banners.html` and 1.2MB of
# announcement photos aside by hand; naming the two directories here does the
# same thing every time and cannot be forgotten. 4 Sep 2026.
mockups
